type motion-action
version 1
---
# The traveller braces against a gust: the right hand holds the hood beside
# the head (anims/SOURCE.md). Entry 0–1.4 s, a held loop 1.4–3.6 s, release
# and recovery after it. handTarget: the right wrist at hood contact, metres
# along the head bone's axes, the mean over the hold.
source "anims/brace.glb"
clip "brace"
rig "rigs/meshy.ogt"
holdStart 1.4
holdEnd 3.6
hand right
handTarget -0.085 0.057 -0.023
